// Generated by ${t.generatedBy}. Run it from File > Scripts > Run Script File... in After Effects.
//
// Builds one composition: a solid per measured shot (trimmed to its in and out), a placeholder text layer per shot
// whose Position and Opacity keyframes enter with the measured timing of the shot's first move (still when no move
// was measured), measured dissolves as opacity ramps of the incoming shot (wipes too: draw their edge with a mask or
